      "detail_url_pattern": "https://de.indeed.com/rc/clk?jk=<jobkey> -- Indeed hides card URLs behind this redirect and 403s every plain HTTP request (verified 2026-09-29: HTTP 403 on /jobs, 28 KB block page). crawl4ai renders BOTH the listing and the detail page; the Camofox accessibility snapshot of the listing contains NO card links at all (verified: 0 occurrences of /rc/clk in a 36 KB snapshot), so crawl4ai is the only route that can see them. Details resolve to the employer's own board, e.g. jk=d4c948bc460ec1d8 -> job.deloitte.com/.../48452.",
      "direct_card_domains": [
        "de.indeed.com"
      ],
      "domain": "de.indeed.com",
      "evidence": {
        "coverage_note": "Term x city matrix: 7 search terms x 7 locations = 49 listing pages, 300 distinct cards / 130 QA (measured 2026-09-29). Indeed has NO pagination (`start=10` returns nothing) and its `remotejoboffer=1` filter is a no-op on this route (58 of 59 cards identical to the unfiltered sweep), so the widenable axes are the term and the location, both of which return near-disjoint card sets. Runtime is not a constraint: the cron runs at night.",
